<title>HONG KONG: Hop Ying changes name to Dong-Jun.</title>
<headline>Hop Ying changes name to Dong-Jun.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hop Ying International Ltd has changed its name to Dong-Jun (Holdings) Ltd, the Stock Exchange said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
